# PII safety: never commit personal data files into apps/web/data/.
# Demo data MUST be synthetic (example.test domain, no real names/emails).
# Real personal CV/profile data belongs in Supabase user_profiles row,
# not in JSON/MD files in repo.
apps/web/data/profile-sergey-backup.json
apps/web/data/cv-sergey-backup.md
apps/web/data/profile-*-backup.*
apps/web/data/cv-*-backup.*
apps/web/data/*.private.json
apps/web/data/*.private.md
apps/web/data/outreach.json
.vercel

